<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-12T03:57:42.316Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:57:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Heavy storms have flooded tens of thousands of tents in Gaza, leaving many displaced in lethal conditions as aid distribution stalls. Israeli forces killed goalkeeper in an attack days after his cup appearance, and Israeli detention has seen the health of Gaza doctor Abu Safia deteriorate. Turkey’s president labeled the Gaza war an ecocide at a UN climate summit, while France turned back settler leader Yossi Dagan on entry to Paris. Lewis Hamilton urged Israel to open the Rafah border for aid. The United Nations reported 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/11/12/iran-war-live-tehran-warns-of-wider-retaliation-israel-kills-in-gaza?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1HSjVxMm5nc0ZudElnaHJPTlhXcHRqUzNhd3ZPYk1nUlpvZEgwS0F6Y21Td0lfelp3cDd6YlJ2OWxUZlhjZUZhelBmSmFMRVZDLUZiazJBUzEzcXRuamc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/israeli-strike-on-southern-gaza-hospital-kills-five-gaza-civil-defence-says/article71692179.ece&quot;&gt;thehindu.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPbWJsX09iak1JNmhabW1OdjdOVW84Yk5iYVI0YmJJeEE1LTc0YTAyamNncXpSbHNGT1ZNOGlNWFotMDNybEo4Uk9oVmVzeEpzdnBsWWxrb3pPbldXQmhMQWd3T3pHd2lGN0xqVVhwSjlBWEwwRXR2U0FLOXZmdTZBWC05Vmx4RVc4ek53ZnBqQ1BBRUlyNWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNelVvSExVbm1SOFhwbklGMUptY2Y1M0pMSU5JSktQWkpsMU03VENsbUlDS2VWNG